   "limitation": "In a real basal cut the tricuspid and pulmonary valves flank the aorta, because the operator tilts slightly off a pure short axis to catch them. This model renders the exact short-axis plane at the aortic valve level, which passes above the tricuspid funnel, so the tricuspid valve is not drawn here. Use the four-chamber or RV-inflow view for it."
  },
